          "message": {
            "text": "POST /update_profile: SQL values remain separate from query syntax [protected_for_claim]. The verified driver binding and injection assessment support data/statement separation for this operation. Field validity and authorization are separate claims. Assessed injection/use protection: sufficient. Injection-specific assessment supports syntax protection for the supplied claim; field validation and construction practice remain separate."
          },
